+| web semantic surface | `dist/web/PIPD_BOOTSTRAP.md`, `PIPD_CANONICAL_CORE.md`, `PIPD_ROUTER_PROFILES.md`, `PIPD_ARTIFACT_SCHEMAS.md`, `PIPD_EVAL_HANDOFF.md` |
